758,-0.0,0.13013,-0.0,-0.0,-0.0,-0.0,0.00695,-0.0,-0.0,0.16927,-0.0,0.12436,-0.0,0.15229,-0.0,0.14975,-0.0,0.15157,0.16575,0.05396,0.06131,-0.0,0.16997,-0.0,0.10421,0.16675,0.16193,-0.0,0.10312,-0.0,-0.0,-0.0,-0.0,0.14303,0.09759,-0.0,0.12557,0.16538,-0.0,-0.0,0.07453,0.16672,0.0574,0.16215,0.07577,-0.0,-0.0,-0.0,-0.0,0.11464,0.16705,0.16009,0.16932,-0.0,0.16482,-0.0,-0.0,0.16341,-0.0],"attends_to":[],"attention_weights":[],"max_activation":0.16997116804122925,"max_token_index":460,"peak_labels":{"hate speech":"none","language":"en","names":"none","part of speech":"VERB","personal data":"none","postal addresses":"none","source":"pile-uncopyrighted","toxicity":"none"},"text":"April TBR | Autism Awareness Month & My Birthday!!\n\nApril is the best month of all because it’s my birthday and it’s right in the middle of the month so I always try to get away with not doing things “because it’s my birthday”. I’ve had a few people ask me about buying me gifts for my birthday – if you would like to buy me anything then you can check out my amazon wishlist! My birthday is April 15th 🙂 That’s right – I am the most irritating combination of a Gryffindor AND being an Aries.\n\nApril is also awesome because its Autism Awareness Month! Sadly, I don’t usually see as many people talking about Autism Awareness Month as they do about other awareness months so I want to try to do some Autism themed posts to celebrate the month!\n\nApril TBR\n\nDon’t talk to me about the state of my TBR this month because it’s such a mess :’) I already had a collection of books left over from last month that I really want to finish reading soon because they’ve been sat on my bookshelves feeling neglected for at least 4 months. I’m also trying to work through my e-ARCs slowly so that I can actually start requesting newer books without feeling an overwhelming sense of guilt. Obviously because it’s my birthday I have SURPRISINGLY asked for more books (I know right, how unexpected) so I want to allow myself the space to actually reading them when I receive them… I have a horrible habit of feeling like I’m not *allowed* to read them straight away and so never end up getting round to reading them so this year I am implementing a new strategy called READ ALL THE BIRTHDAY BOOKS. As it’s my birthday month, I had also instated a library ban on myself but as you can see that didn’t go to well… I blame Obsidio and Children of Blood and Bone screaming at me from the shelves. I am weak and the library is strong.\n\nOMG you have amazing books on your TBR! I love Legend by Marie Lu! I need to reread it! ACOTAR I have mixed feelings about but I might reread it just to see why I didn’t exactly like it. Hope you enjoy your reading! 🙂","tokens":["April"," T","BR"," |"," Aut","ism"," Aw","areness"," Month"," &"," My"," Birth","day","!!","\n","\n","April"," is"," the"," best"," month"," of"," all"," because"," it","’","s"," my"," birthday"," and"," it","’","s"," right"," in"," the"," middle"," of"," the"," month"," so"," I"," always"," try"," to"," get"," away"," with"," not"," doing"," things"," “","because"," it","’","s"," my"," birthday","”."," I","’","ve"," had"," a"," few"," people"," ask"," me"," about"," buying"," me"," gifts"," for"," my"," birthday"," –"," if"," you"," would"," like"," to"," buy"," me"," anything"," then"," you"," can"," check"," out"," my"," amaz","on"," wish","list","!"," My"," birthday"," is"," April"," 15","th"," 🙂"," That","’","s"," right"," –"," I"," am"," the"," most"," irrit","ating"," combination"," of"," a"," G","ry","ff","ind","or"," AND"," being"," an"," A","ries",".","\n","\n","April"," is"," also"," awesome"," because"," its"," Aut","ism"," Aw","areness"," Month","!"," Sadly",","," I"," don","’","t"," usually"," see"," as"," many"," people"," talking"," about"," Aut","ism"," Aw","areness"," Month"," as"," they"," do"," about"," other"," awareness"," months"," so"," I"," want"," to"," try"," to"," do"," some"," Aut","ism"," them","ed"," posts"," to